  "durationSeconds": 83.033333,
  "caption": "What if everything you’re experiencing is precisely what’s preparing you for what you’ve been seeking? Don’t wish this season away.",
  "transcript": {
    "text": "I'm a big believer in having faith that everything that you're going through is getting you ready for what you asked for. And if you're anything like me, you asked for a lot. You have very big dreams, and you know that you're here on this Earth for a purpose. And if you're also like me, that means probably for a while now, you've felt stuck. You've felt like things aren't moving in the way that you'd like them to. We have to remind ourselves that this is just part of it. The bigger the dream, the more that we're going to have to carry. And the more that we're going to have to carry, the more that we're going to have to be developed, the stronger that we're going to have to be. I know that you probably look outward and you start to compare yourself with people. Well, how did they get it? Why do they have it? Maybe they've already gone through their development. Who knows? It's not our job to compare. It's not our job to judge. That is their life, and we need to have the attitude of good for them. And we need to put on the horse blinders and stop thinking about everyone else and realize I got to learn how to carry my destiny. Stop doubting yourself. Stop doubting that things aren't going to work out. It is going to work out. In the future, it already has worked out. Start acting like it.",
    "segments": null,
    "timing": "unavailable"
  },
